sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "@drmichaellevin 8-law mathematical synthesis & biological-law-criteria suite — Source and data traceability: 88/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-24"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Positives: all 17 bib DOIs resolve via Crossref (checked 2026-10-25) with title, author list and locator of record - including the three Pass 3.1 defects: Ross 10.1017/9781009300940 (monograph, 2025) (+7), froese2024 single-author with the title of record (+4), hoel2026ce2 title of record (+1), Ross year 2025 (+1); every one of the 8 laws has at least one DOI; all 63 video IDs resolve in the hash-pinned catalog; Stoica is gone from the Law 5 name, Albantakis has an identifier and Morozov is a catalogued channel speaker (+3 of -5 restored); 'Sweet (2026)' is gone from the criteria doc (+1 net of its survival at KG L129). Deductions: residual stale attributions - Lean L229 'Albantakis (2024)' and L255 'Morozov (2026)', theorem name L276, script comments L552 / L683, KG domain_summary L1068 / L1139 and the pinned catalog labels - and the Albantakis identifier is the IIT 4.0 paper rather than a causal-emergence paper (-2); Law 1 lists Beane and Pezzulo scripts under implemented_by but the synthesis neither imports nor calls them (-3); no crawl or regeneration script for the catalog is committed (-3); README L4 still points to 'MathOfBiology.lean (§17)', which the committed file does not contain (-1); KG m4 asserts a Crossref result under the referee's meas_id that the referee had not yet made (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/source-traceability" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/README.md L4–L4: README: '... universally quantified in morphoeval/lean/MathOfBiology.lean (§17) and morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean'. The committed MathOfBiology.lean (956 lines, ac8ca6c4...) has no Levin section; only the Loop module carries the 8 theorems <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/README.md#L4-L4>",
            "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/levin_youtube_catalog.json L508–L521: Catalog entry for Alexandre V. Morozov's talk 'Evolution of cooperativity in the game of Prisoner's Dilemma' with mappedMathLaws 'levin-youtube-channel-math-8 (Shreesha-Morozov-Levin ...)'. Morozov is a traceable channel source for Law 8 even without a paper identifier; the hash-pinned label now disagrees with the Law 8 name in script / docs / YAML <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/levin_youtube_catalog.json#L508-L521>",
            "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib L142–L152: albantakis2023iit4: 10.1371/journal.pcbi.1011465 resolves (PLOS Comput. Biol. 19(10):e1011465, 16 authors, 2023). It is 'Integrated information theory (IIT) 4.0', cited at docs L33 for the Albantakis 'causal borders' talk and at YAML L130 for Law 7 (Causal Emergence 2.0); a loosely related identifier, and Loop .lean L229 still reads 'Albantakis (2024)' <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib#L142-L152>",
            "models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py L726–L726: Law 1 implemented_by: 2011-beane... and 2015-pezzulo...; neither is imported, read or executed anywhere in this script, so the attribution is not a trace (unchanged) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L726-L726>",
            "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean L229–L229: 'Hoel (2026) & Albantakis (2024) Causal Emergence 2.0 ...': no 2024 Albantakis work is cited anywhere in the package; the bib's Albantakis entry is 2023 (IIT 4.0). Lean file unchanged since Pass 3 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean#L229-L229>",
            "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean L255–L256: 'Shreesha & Levin (2025) / Morozov (2026) ...' and theorem shreesha_morozov_... (L276): 'Morozov (2026)' has no identifier; the script (L821), docs (L66) and YAML (L132) dropped Morozov from the law name in Pass 3.2 but the Lean header, script comments L552 / L683 and KG L1139 did not follow <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean#L255-L256>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-6>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-7>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-8> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.88"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib L1–L205" ;
        dcterms:description "18 entries; all 17 DOIs resolve via api.crossref.org (2026-10-25) with title and author list of record, and shreesha2025's OSF URL returns 200. Laws 1-8 each have >= 1 DOI" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib#L1-L205> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib L154–L162" ;
        dcterms:description "ross2025explanation: @book, Ross LN, Explanation in Biology, Cambridge Elements in the Philosophy of Biology, CUP, 2025, doi 10.1017/9781009300940. Crossref: monograph, author Ross, issued 2025. Same DOI and year at docs L31 and KG L65. Closes Pass 3.1 R3 (third identifier for this work; first that resolves)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib#L154-L162> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib L176–L186" ;
        dcterms:description "froese2024absorption: author Froese T only; title 'Irruption and Absorption: A Black-Box Framework for How Mind and Matter Make a Difference to Each Other'; Entropy 26(4):288. Matches the Crossref record for 10.3390/e26040288. Closes Pass 3.1 R4" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib#L176-L186> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-4> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib L130–L140" ;
        dcterms:description "hoel2026ce2 title 'Quantifying emergent complexity' with note 'title of record in Crossref'; Patterns 7(1):101472, 2026 - matches" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/paper_citations.bib#L130-L140> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-5> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md L31–L31" ;
        dcterms:description "C2 row: 'Ross, L. N. (2025). Explanation in Biology (... doi:10.1017/9781009300940)'. api.crossref.org/works/10.1017/9781009300940 -> monograph, Ross, 2025. Resolves" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md#L31-L31> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-6> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/levin_youtube_channel/README.md L9–L9" ;
        dcterms:description "README records SHA-256 216a474f... and says it is verified at runtime; the script pins the same value (L63) and asserts the match (L845)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/datasets/levin_youtube_channel/README.md#L9-L9> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-7> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py L99–L118" ;
        dcterms:description "verify_catalog_and_video_ids: loads, hashes, compares with EXPECTED_CATALOG_SHA256, resolves 63 cited IDs (all present; reproduced)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L99-L118> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-source-traceability-8> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md L28–L35" ;
        dcterms:description "21 video IDs and 10 publication dates quoted in the C1-C6 provenance column match the catalog (checked programmatically in Pass 3; catalog unchanged since)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md#L28-L35> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic; independent cross-provider MorphoEval referee, Pass 3 / 3.1 / 3.2)" ;
